{"v":4,"catch":"你能把地層的演變走多遠？","desc":"《PHOZON》是NAMCO於1983年發行的動作遊戲。\n控制一個名為 CHEMIC 的原子核並與 MOLECULES 合併以完成指定的編隊。\n編隊變得越來越複雜，但這只會讓完成它們更令人滿意。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-11-25","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.0GB / Switch 0.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4fa107083427a2da82df7b32ca1d545d5c9a48cdbb31fd91dbf97aa26bd0e8bc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/efc6de0894f9a5d73195c478ea8a16b08bf04e977428e9d3ff61cc9000ce6769.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c785ee7351bcb0adf66b4755678d01aa410e80831621a68c5aaa8e684aa19fc7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d167c0353f68771adec08627825cc5647c926723a070c0b042823bfa10de2c95.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/79884b4a712ab444936260225ebea3088e0cdb535b26935811ca90e2c44a3328.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/42fffbf9532d2d16eee7cbc27f79556a2c3bb9568713c34d5050d7bd5596bbbc.jpg"],"titleId":"010016e015d26000","dlc":[]}